# Whitelist: only what the image COPYs goes into the build context (never the repo's PNGs, notes,
# PDFs, .venv or artifacts).
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!docker/constraints.txt
!configs/
!claimscan/
# secrets never enter the build context (already excluded by *, listed so it stays that way)
.env
.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
claimscan/**/*.png
